"A decrease of the response function smaller than this value is ignored as "
"negligible; larger ones are counted and tested. The default .03 follows "
"Molenaar and Sijtsma (2000; see references). Lowering it makes the check "
"more sensitive and flags more, mostly trivial, violations."
