#: R/texts.R
msgid ""
"Listwise deletion keeps only respondents who answered every selected item, "
"because mokken does not accept missing scores. It is appropriate when few "
"cases are incomplete and missingness is unrelated to the trait. With many "
"incomplete cases it wastes information and may bias the results; two-way "
"imputation is then preferable."
